cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it and the associated Master's Thesis when appropriate."
title: "IP Traffic Forecasting with Machine Learning"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Gámez Cartagena"
    given-names: "Fernando Tomás"
abstract: >-
  Curated research repository derived from the Master's Thesis
  "Predicción de tráfico IP mediante aprendizaje automático", covering
  multihorizon IP-traffic forecasting with statistical, machine-learning and
  deep-learning model families, temporal external evaluation, residual
  analysis and reproducibility documentation.
keywords:
  - IP traffic forecasting
  - time series
  - machine learning
  - deep learning
  - ARIMA
  - VAR
  - recurrent neural networks
  - Transformer
  - telecommunications
repository-code: "https://github.com/Narvalaina/ip-traffic-forecasting-ml"
version: "1.0.1"
date-released: "2026-10-07"
